span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ MSC 멘토 대학수학1, 대학수학2, 일반물리학1, 일반물리학2, 일반화학1, 일반화학2에 한함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.3pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;교양 멘토의 경우 교양교직과정부에서 지원 교과목 선정하여 선발.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.3pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">○</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 멘토 활동을 원하는 학생은 [붙임3]의 지원서 양식을 작성하고 해당 교과목 담당 교수의 승인을 얻은 후 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">전공 일반 및 전공 외국어 멘토는 학부(과)</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">에, </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">교양 및 MSC 멘토 중 대학수학1, 대학수학2, 일반화학1, 일반화학2는 학부(과)에 교양, 일반물리학1, 일반물리학2는 교양교직과정부에 제출</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; TEXT-INDENT: -28.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 28.3pt\" class=\"HStyle1\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11.4pt\">&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\"> </span></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt\">○</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 멘토는 2회 이상 멘티의 학습능력에 대한 평가를 실시하고 이와 관련된 증빙서류를 제출.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. 2012-2학기 교과목 멘토 운영 계획</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; <strong>가. 멘토배정 및 멘토의 선발</strong> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -46.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">멘토 배정 : 배정내역 [붙임1]참조</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -46.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2) 멘토 신청 기간 : 2012.09.24(월)까지. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -42.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3) </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">멘토 대상</span>&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -42.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.3pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">-</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 당해학기 재학중인 3학년 또는 4학년생</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 중 성적이</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 우수한 학생.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -42.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 48.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 담당교수 추천 학생 우선 배정, 직전 학기 성적 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">평점평균이 3.5이상</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 혹은 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">해당 교과목 학점 A이상.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -42.5pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 42.5pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.9pt; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;※ 그린에너지융합센터 튜터 관련 사업 참여 학생 지원 불가.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">멘토 대상 수업 </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">- 교양 및 MSC 멘토 : 교양 및 MSC 강좌.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">※ MSC 교과목의 경우 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">대학수학1, 대학수학2, 일반물리학1, 일반물리학2, 일반화학1, 일반화학2에 한함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#5d5d5d\">- 전공멘토 : 학부(과)별 전공과목 및 학부 관리 MSC 강좌.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 전공영어 : 2012-2학기 개설된 전공영어 강좌.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5) 멘토 활동 시간</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 멘토는 한 학기동안 40시간 이상의 교육 진행.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1주 6시간을 초과하지 못함.)</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-INDENT: -45.7pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.7pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6) 멘티 모집 인원</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 교양 및 MSC, 전공과목 멘토 : 10명 이상.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 전공영어 멘토 : 5명 이상.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7) 선발된 멘토는&nbsp;학부(과), 교양교직과정부에서&nbsp;실시하는 오리엔테이션에 참여 하여야 함. </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; <strong>나. 1학기 멘토 지도 기간</strong> :</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 09. 01 ～ 12. 22일까지</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp; 다. 멘토 신청 및 운영 절차</strong> </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -38.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 38.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;1) 학부(과)별로 </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">멘토 운영계획을 수립하여 공고 : 지도교과목, 지도교수, 멘토&nbsp;신청 기준.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 멘토를 희망하는 학생은 학부(과, 전공)에 멘토 지원 신청서를 제출. </span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: justify; TEXT-INDENT: -53.3pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 53.3pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--> <span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">※ 교양 관련 과목, MSC 과목 중 일반물리학1, 일반물리학2 교과의 멘토를 희망하는 학생은 교양교직과정부에 멘토 지원 신청서 제출.</span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -46.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 46.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 학부(과)장은 배정된 멘토 인원 범위 내에서 멘토를 선정.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 지도과목별 멘토 지도교수 및 멘티를 선정.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -39.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 39.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 선발된 멘토는 지도교수의 지도에 따라 멘토 역할을 수행.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;라. 멘토의 역할 및 임무</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) 멘토의 역할 : 해당 교과목의 과목 조교로서 지도교수의 지도를 받아&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;이론 교과목의 연습문제 풀이, 이론시조 등 멘티 학생의</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학습향상 지원.&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -44.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 44.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; ※ 학기 동안 멘티를 대상으로 2회 이상의 학습능력 평가를 실시하여야 함. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 운영시 멘토링 운영일지, 멘토링 출석부를 작성하여야 함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -45.2pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 45.2pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) 멘토 활동 종료후 운영일지 및 결과보고서 등 관련서류를 멘토 지도교수의 확인을 받아</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 학부(과)에 제출하여야 함.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -37.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 37.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 11.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 제출서류</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 멘토링 결과보고서</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;- 멘토링 운영일지 및 내용 요약서</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; -&nbsp;멘토링 출석부</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 멘토 신분증 사본 및 통장사본</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 멘티 만족도 조사서 (만족도 조사 집계표 작성하여 함께 제출)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 학습 능력 평가 결과물</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><strong>&nbsp;마. 지급시기 및 금액</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1) 지급시기 : 2012-2학기 정규수업 종료후 지급. </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;2) 지급금액 : 1인당 600,000원 지급.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -30pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 30pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(중도에 포기한 멘토에게는 수업한 시간당 6,000원 지급)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font color=\"#cc3d3d\">※ 기타 자세한 사항은 학부(과) 또는 교양교직과정부로 문의.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font color=\"#8c8c8c\">붙임&nbsp; 1. 2012-2학기 멘토 배정 내역 1부.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\"><font color=\"#8c8c8c\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 멘토&nbsp;지원 신청 서식&nbsp;1부.&nbsp; 끝.</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-INDENT: -49.8pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 49.8pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 13pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'\"><br></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
